      "lastSeenAt": "2026-10-07T04:59:09.662Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-10-03T15:25:25.848Z",
      "description": "Bring your Canva design workflow into Codex and create, refine, and review designs through natural conversation.\n\nWhat Canva can do: \nCreate designs: Turn a brief, outline, or draft copy into a presentation, doc, poster, flyer, social post, resume, and more. \nGenerate images: Create photos, illustrations, icons, and graphics from a prompt, or restyle an image you already have. \nRemove backgrounds: Lift the subject out of an image onto a transparent background. Upload files: Bring attachments and files from your chat into Canva to use in your designs. \nResize for social media: Adapt a design for Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn in one step. \nBulk create: Generate multiple designs from spreadsheet data using a brand template. \nEdit designs: Update text, media, and formatting, or reposition and resize elements. \nGet design feedback: Receive structured feedback on visual hierarchy, layout, readability, consistency, and accessibility. \nImplement feedback: Review comment threads and apply clear, actionable changes. Brand check: Check colors, fonts, logo usage, and copy against your Brand Kit.\n\nOnce installed, describe what you want in plain language or invoke Canva directly with @Canva.\n\nTry prompts like:\n\n@Canva, create a pitch deck from this outline.\n@Canva, make an Instagram post announcing our Friday sale.\n@Canva, generate an illustration of a lighthouse at dawn.\n@Canva, remove the background from this photo.\n@Canva, upload this PDF and turn it into a presentation.\n@Canva, resize this design for social media.\n@Canva, create designs from this spreadsheet using my brand template.\n@Canva, update the headline in this design.\n@Canva, implement the feedback in the comment threads.\n@Canva, check this design against my Brand Kit.\nRequirements: Connect your Canva account to use the plugin. Bulk Create requires an eligible Canva Enterprise plan. Design and image generation use Canva AI credits.\n\nWant to take a more hands-on approach? Instantly open your design in Canva's powerful editor for the final touches.",
