      "status": "active",
      "missingCount": 0,
      "detailDue": false,
      "seeded": true,
      "legacySummary": "助力在 YouTube、Instagram 与 TikTok 上成长",
      "legacySummaryOriginal": "Grow on YouTube, IG & TikTok",
      "lastSeenAt": "2026-10-07T04:59:09.662Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-10-03T15:25:25.848Z",
      "description": "Find your next video idea, learn from other creators, and improve your content with vidIQ in ChatGPT.\n\nWith vidIQ, you can:\n\n• Find ideas and study competitors: discover videos outperforming their creators’ usual results on YouTube, Instagram and TikTok. Find similar YouTube channels and explore their uploads.\n\n• Check demand before filming: compare YouTube keyword search estimates and competition, explore related terms, and see views-per-hour trends where available.\n\n• Understand your channel and audience: review YouTube views, watch time, retention and traffic sources. Explore comments for questions and ideas for your next video.\n\n• Learn from other videos: break down hooks, structure and key moments with YouTube transcripts and visual analysis of videos, Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikToks.\n\n• Improve your titles and thumbnails: get feedback on YouTube titles and thumbnails, generate alternative titles, and compare vidIQ scores before choosing what to test.\n\n• Create and repurpose content: write scripts, generate creative assets, and turn long videos into vertical clips for YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok.",
      "information": [
