      ],
      "status": "active",
      "missingCount": 0,
      "detailDue": false,
      "seeded": true,
      "legacySummary": "设计、合成与编辑",
      "legacySummaryOriginal": "Design, combine, and edit",
      "legacyDescriptionSource": "Adobe unlocks more ways to create and get work done from the conversation. Previously available as Photoshop, the Adobe connector now brings creativity and productivity capabilities across Creative Cloud and Acrobat. Describe what you want to make or change, and Adobe can help turn ideas, images, videos, and documents into polished outputs — from editing photos and creating PDFs to designing social assets, resizing videos, searching Creative Cloud assets, and generating data-driven documents. Key capabilities: * Retouch portraits or edit photos in bulk: Drop in photos and describe the look you want — adjust color, lighting, and tone; remove distractions and generate new elements; apply Lightroom presets; remove backgrounds; blur, crop, resize, and expand images. * Design from template: Start from an Express template, update text and colors, and then animate for social media or convert to PDF. * Refine video for any platform: Upload a horizontal clip and ask to reformat it for YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, or any platform. You can also stitch clips into a single sequence. * Search and organize creative work: Describe what you're looking for and surface assets from your Creative Cloud library — by subject, style, mood, or content — without browsing folders.",
      "lastSeenAt": "2026-10-07T04:59:09.662Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-10-03T15:25:25.848Z",
      "description": "Adobe unlocks more ways to create and get work done from the conversation. Previously available as Photoshop, the Adobe connector now brings creativity and productivity capabilities across Creative Cloud and Acrobat. Describe what you want to make or change, and Adobe can help turn ideas, images, videos, and documents into polished outputs — from editing photos and creating PDFs to designing social assets, resizing videos, searching Creative Cloud assets, and generating data-driven documents.\nKey capabilities:\n\n* Retouch portraits or edit photos in bulk: Drop in photos and describe the look you want — adjust color, lighting, and tone; remove distractions and generate new elements; apply Lightroom presets; remove backgrounds; blur, crop, resize, and expand images.\n* Design from template: Start from an Express template, update text and colors, and then animate for social media or convert to PDF.\n* Refine video for any platform: Upload a horizontal clip and ask to reformat it for YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, or any platform. You can also stitch clips into a single sequence.\n* Search and organize creative work: Describe what you're looking for and surface assets from your Creative Cloud library — by subject, style, mood, or content — without browsing folders.\n* Work with PDFs and documents: Create and convert polished PDFs and documents.\n* Create data-driven documents: Describe your output and provide your data — the connector turns raw data or content into formatted, shareable PDFs, including badges, cards, catalogs, and more.\n\nYou can get started as a guest, and sign in with your Adobe account for more capabilities and tools, Creative Cloud storage, and saved work across sessions.",
      "information": [
        {
          "label": "Developer",
          "value": "Adobe Inc",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Category",
          "value": "Creativity",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Website",
          "value": "",
          "links": [
            "https://www.adobe.com/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Version",
          "value": "10.0.0",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "extractionMethod": "rendered-description-metadata-match",
      "detailCheckedAt": "2026-10-03T15:26:04.407Z",
      "translationAttemptRun": "37134929786",
      "translation": {
        "summary": "设计、合并和编辑",
        "description": "Adobe 让你在对话中拥有更多创作和完成工作的方式。此前以 Photoshop 提供的 Adobe 连接器，如今涵盖 Creative Cloud 和 Acrobat 的创意与生产力功能。描述你想制作或修改的内容，Adobe 就能帮助将想法、图像、视频和文档变为精美成果——从编辑照片、创建 PDF，到设计社交媒体素材、调整视频尺寸、搜索 Creative Cloud 素材，以及生成数据驱动的文档。\n主要功能：\n\n* 精修人像或批量编辑照片：添加照片并描述你想要的效果——调整色彩、光照和色调；移除干扰元素并生成新元素；应用 Lightroom 预设；移除背景；模糊、裁剪、调整尺寸和扩展图像。\n* 基于模板设计：从 Express 模板开始，更新文字和颜色，然后为社交媒体添加动画或转换为 PDF。\n* 为任何平台优化视频：上传横向视频片段，要求重新排版以适配 YouTube Shorts、Instagram Reels 或任何平台。你还可以将多个片段拼接为一个连续视频。\n* 搜索和整理创意作品：描述所需内容，即可按主题、风格、氛围或内容从 Creative Cloud 素材库中找到素材，无需浏览文件夹。\n* 处理 PDF 和文档：创建和转换精美的 PDF 和文档。\n* 创建数据驱动的文档：描述想要的输出并提供数据——连接器将原始数据或内容转换为排版完善、可分享的 PDF，包括徽章、卡片、目录等。\n\n你可以以访客身份开始使用，也可以登录 Adobe 账户，获得更多功能和工具、Creative Cloud 存储空间，以及跨会话保存的作品。",
        "sourceHash": "1a24c8370ba15cae48d0b3f6b43c2e260ced9074b6899e1757487d4151d11e88",
        "status": "translated",
        "model": "codex-subagent-reviewed",
