      "legacySummary": "直接在 ChatGPT 中设计",
      "legacySummaryOriginal": "Design directly in ChatGPT",
      "legacyDescriptionSource": "MagicPath is an Al design and prototyping tool for creating interactive websites, app interfaces, dashboards, and visual plans on a shared canvas. With the MagicPath plugin, describe what you want to make and turn your ideas, notes, or existing designs into editable work you can explore and refine.\nCreate a landing page, prototype an app, or design a dashboard with working interactions. Compare multiple Ul and UX design directions, refine layouts and content, and apply reusable themes for a consistent look. Turn meeting notes, product requirements, or a process into flowcharts, wireframes, user journeys, and workshop boards that make the next step easier to understand.\nMagicPath supports designers, product managers, founders, marketers, developers, educators, and teams planning how something should look or work. Keep related designs together in team projects and share links for review. In a coding environment with file access, adapt existing React Ul code into MagicPath or export React and TypeScript components to continue implementation in your app.",
